            <ArticleTitle>[Ketamine in the management of intractable phantom pain].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>3481-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of phantom limb pain, which had not successfully responded to a long list of medical therapy or neurosurgery, is presented. After oral ketamine treatment was instituted the patient became free of pain. A possible mode of action is described.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
